# resized copies under static/images/ are part of the site.
/AmazonPhotos/
/AmazonPhotos.zip
/IMG_*.jpg
/PXL_*.jpg
# WSL "downloaded from the internet" markers
*:Zone.Identifier

### Node / test toolchain ###
node_modules/
/tmp/

