### Claude Code local session state ###
# Resume checkpoints and agent worktrees are per-machine scratch, not project
# files. Listed individually rather than ignoring .claude/ wholesale so that a
# settings.json or a command added later still shows up in git status.
/.claude/RESUME.md
/.claude/worktrees/
